✓ preview 已生成（只读引擎, 未动 vault 任何既有文件）: /private/tmp/card-g56c-r7.o7v1JT/fence-info-matrix/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json / /private/tmp/card-g56c-r7.o7v1JT/fence-info-matrix/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.md
